top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0\">Founder, Krizaka</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table align=\"center\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" role=\"contentinfo\" class=\"kz-pad\" style=\"padding:20px 16px 8px\"><tbody><tr><td><p class=\"kz-muted\" style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:18px;margin:0 0 8px;color:#566073;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0\">You receive this email because this address was entered in the subscription form of blog.krizaka.com.</p><p class=\"kz-muted\" style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:18px;margin:0 0 8px;color:#566073;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0\"><a class=\"kz-link\" href=\"https://blog.krizaka.com/newsletter/\" style=\"color:#275782;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline\" target=\"_blank\">Privacy</a> · <a class=\"kz-link\" href=\"https://www.krizaka.com/contact\" style=\"color:#275782;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline\" target=\"_blank\">Contact</a></p><p class=\"kz-muted\" style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:18px;margin:0 0 8px;color:#566073;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0\">Sent by Technologies Krizaka Inc., __SENDER_ADDRESS__.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>",
    "text": "Krizaka\n\n\nCONFIRM YOUR SUBSCRIPTION\n\nHello,\n\nSomeone, probably you, asked to receive the new posts of the Krizaka blog at this address.\n\nConfirm my subscription https://blog.krizaka.com/api/newsletter/confirm?t=__CONFIRM_TOKEN__\n\nThe link is valid for 48 hours.\n\nIf it wasn't you, ignore this email: nothing was recorded, and you won't hear from us again.\n\n----------------------------------------\n\nOussama\n\nFounder, Krizaka\n\nYou receive this email because this address was entered in the subscription form of blog.krizaka.com.\n\nPrivacy https://blog.krizaka.com/newsletter/ · Contact https://www.krizaka.com/contact\n\nSent by Technologies Krizaka Inc., __SENDER_ADDRESS__."
  },
